            <p>Coaching can be prompted by personal or professional reasons, and the two often overlap: work-related concerns are frequently tied to your own patterns and to the circumstances of your organization.</p>
            <p>Coaching suits people who want to grow and value a conversation between equals. Whether you are living with an open question or working toward a goal, growth often happens in conversation with others. We approach your concerns in a resource- and solution-oriented way: you widen your sphere of influence, build new skills and take responsibility for your own change. I support you along the way; the decisions stay with you.</p><button class="rd-readmore" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="faq-toggle"></span><span class="rd-readmore-t">Read more</span></button>
